OL,3,GNEWSA'Everyone wants to spot a
OL,4,Acelebrity' as town turns into TV set
OL,5,
OL,6,FWrapped up warm and clutching hot
OL,7,Fchocolates, visitors to a North
OL,8,FYorkshire town lined the market square
OL,9,Fto catch a glimpse of two TV stars
OL,10,Ffilming a new eight-part series, which
OL,11,Fbrought award-winning actors Claire Foy
OL,12,Fand Matthew Macfadyen to Richmond on
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FOnlookers spotted them entering a hotel
OL,16,Fdressed in waterproof walking gear, as
OL,17,Ftheir characters' love story, adapted
OL,18,Ffrom David Nicholls' romance novel You
OL,19,FAre Here, is set along the
OL,20,FCoast-to-Coast walking trail.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
