OL,3,GNEWSA'Everyone wants to spot a
OL,4,Acelebrity' as town turns into TV set
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite a lot of parking spaces being
OL,7,Frestricted for filming, crowds still
OL,8,Fshowed up and filled the local venues.
OL,10,FTenille Wren, who runs the Town Hall
OL,11,FPub and Dining, said the day as a
OL,12,F"pleasant surprise".
